{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>憑神曲《idol》爆紅的日本超人氣組合YOASOBI，即將展開出道以來最大規模的海外巡迴演唱會《YOASOBI 11-CITY ASIA-OCEANIA TOUR 2026-2027 “超惑星/SUPER PLANET》。組合將相隔兩年再來港，明年1月21及22日假亞洲博覽館Areaa連開兩場，消息一出即掀起一片撲飛熱。</p><p>門票於昨日(17日）下午於網上平台公開發售，輪候人數一度超過100萬人，相當誇張！門票已火速售罄。主辦單位官方社交平台發文表示：「門票已經全部售罄！多謝支持，我哋2027年1月21､22號見！」</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T13:44:04.921211+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":267,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T13:04:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T14:11:45.428984+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T13:37:21.109978+00:00","content_hash":"5a03771f30d6fc324733881e23990f799d6c778e325978e8697157be1f459196","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T13:44:04.921211+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}